    "primary_finding": "Very low overlap (5 matches at < 5 arcsec, 0.2%) between DESI spectral anomalies and GZ DESI chirality catalog, driven by non-overlapping selection functions: GZ covers bright (r < 17.8), low-z galaxies; DESI anomalies are predominantly faint (median r ~ 21), high-z (median z ~ 0.66) objects.",
